      "content": "that's a really good start. i love the part about \"shared humanity.\" can you expand on that part? like, can you make it even more undeniable that it's wrong to prioritize our own citizens over people dying in famine or war zones? i want the donors to feel like staying neutral on this is basically morally indefensible.",
